    IDS_TIP_MASK "File masks, for example *.txt; separate masks with spaces or semicolons. Use | before exclusions."
    IDS_TIP_KEEP "Save verified originals before overwrites and deletions. Uses additional disk space. When off, no new recovery copies are created; existing backups are kept."
    IDS_TIP_DELETE "All visible eligible right-only files and directories in asymmetric mode. Highlighting does not limit the operation. Filtered out and Skip rows are excluded. Directories require all descendants in the visible deletion plan."
    IDS_TIP_SCOPE "All visible eligible proposals, regardless of highlighted rows. Filtered out and Skip rows are excluded. Each operation requires confirmation."
    IDS_TIP_SELECTION "On the next Compare, scan the selection originally captured from the file panels, not highlighted preview rows. Current results remain unchanged."
    IDS_TIP_EMPTY "Include empty folders on the next Compare. Current results remain unchanged. In asymmetric mode also include right-only directories for deletion."
