    IDS_UI_DELETED_DIRECTORIES "Deleted directories"
    IDS_UI_FILES "Eligible visible files"
    IDS_UI_BYTES "New main data (bytes)"
    IDS_UI_ORIGINAL_BYTES "Original main data (bytes)"
    IDS_UI_OMITTED "Other visible proposals omitted"
    IDS_UI_COPIED "Copied and verified"
    IDS_UI_REPLACED "Replaced and verified"
    IDS_UI_DELETED "Deleted files"
    IDS_UI_ERRORS "Errors / cancelled items"
    IDS_UI_PENDING "Not started"
    IDS_UI_LOGGED "Result records written"
    IDS_UI_RECOVERY "Keep originals"
    IDS_UI_ON "ON"
    IDS_UI_OFF "OFF - no recovery copy from this run"
    IDS_UI_RECOVERED "Originals saved / selected"
    IDS_UI_MANIFEST "Recovery manifest"
    IDS_UI_JOURNAL "Execution journal"
    IDS_UI_COPY_POLICY "Copies data, the supported ADS set and metadata, then verifies them. Files and empty directories inherit destination permissions. Directory ADS are not supported. Required parent folders may be created. Existing targets are never replaced. Stop preserves completed files; empty created parents may remain."
    IDS_UI_SAVE_POLICY "Creates independent, verified copies and a manifest in an existing recovery folder outside both trees. Originals remain unchanged; no proposal is executed. Recovery copies inherit the recovery folder permissions. Stop preserves completed copies."
    IDS_UI_OVERWRITE_POLICY "New targets and deletions are omitted. Replaces existing file names after staging and verification, preserving original target permissions. Read-only targets are refused without attribute changes. Stop preserves completed replacements; there is no automatic rollback."
    IDS_UI_DELETE_POLICY "Only visible Delete on right proposals for right-only files and directories in asymmetric mode are eligible. Directories are removed deepest first, only when actually empty. Filtered or skipped contents protect their parents. The Recycle Bin is not used. Read-only files are refused without attribute changes. Stop preserves completed deletions; there is no automatic rollback."
    IDS_UI_RESULT_NOTE "Inspect the result, then Compare again before another operation. Compare rebuilds proposals; reapply manual Skip if needed. Ctrl+C copies a selected value; Ctrl+Shift+C copies the full summary."
    IDS_UI_COPY_VALUE "Copy &value\tCtrl+C"
    IDS_UI_COPY_ALL "Copy &all\tCtrl+Shift+C"
    IDS_UI_CLIPBOARD_ERROR "Could not copy the text to the clipboard."
    IDS_UI_ADS_NOTE "Byte counts exclude alternate data streams (ADS)."
    IDS_UI_SCOPE_LABEL "Scope"
    IDS_UI_SCOPE_VALUE "All visible eligible proposals"
    IDS_UI_SCOPE_NOTE "Highlighted rows do not limit these commands. Filtered out and Skip rows are excluded. Use the combined visible-plan command or run each operation separately."
    IDS_UI_PLAN_NOTE "Proposals only, for all visible rows regardless of highlighting. Run copies, overwrites and deletions separately; each requires confirmation. Copy counts and bytes include both new and existing targets. Only right-only files and directories can be deleted in asymmetric mode; directories require all descendants in the visible deletion plan. Compare rebuilds proposals; reapply manual Skip if needed."
    IDS_UI_TO_RIGHT "Copies to right (count / main bytes)"
    IDS_UI_TO_LEFT "Copies to left (count / main bytes)"
    IDS_UI_DELETE_RIGHT "Proposed deletions on right (includes folders)"
    IDS_UI_UNRESOLVED "Visible unresolved"
    IDS_UI_BLOCKED "Blocked / conflicts (all rows)"
    IDS_UI_HIDDEN "Hidden rows"
    IDS_UI_COPY_BYTES "Main data (bytes; ADS additional)"
    IDS_UI_READY "Ready"
    IDS_UI_SCAN "Scanning"
    IDS_UI_COMPARE "Comparing content"
    IDS_UI_VALIDATE "Checking plan"
    IDS_UI_TRANSFER "Item %llu / %llu"
    IDS_UI_FINISHED "Run finished - inspect result and Compare again"
    IDS_UI_STOPPING "Stopping - waiting for the current operation"
    IDS_UI_SUMMARY "OK"
    IDS_UI_OP_COPY "Copying / verifying"
    IDS_UI_OP_SAVE "Saving / verifying originals"
    IDS_UI_OP_OVERWRITE "Backup / overwrite"
    IDS_UI_OP_DELETE "Backup / delete"
    IDS_UI_RECOVERY_FOLDER "Recovery folder"
    IDS_UI_COMPLETE "Comparison complete"
    IDS_UI_ERROR_DETAILS "Error / staging details"
    IDS_DELETE_EMPTY "No visible Delete on right proposal is a supported right-only item from an asymmetric comparison. Nothing to delete."
    IDS_DELETE_ON "Keeping originals: ON. All originals must be independently saved, verified and logged outside both trees before any deletion."
    IDS_DELETE_OFF "Keeping originals: OFF. Deleted data and ADS will have NO recovery copy from this run."
    IDS_DELETE_FAILED "The deletion worker failed. Some files or directories may have been deleted. Inspect the right tree and any recovery folder before retrying."
    IDS_DELETE_INCOMPLETE "The run is incomplete. Completed deletions remain; inspect the result and any manifests."
    IDS_DELETE_RECOVERY_ERROR "Preserving an original failed; no deletions were started."
    IDS_OVERWRITE_EMPTY "No visible copy proposal has an existing supported file on both sides. Nothing to overwrite."
    IDS_OVERWRITE_ON "Keeping originals: ON. All originals must be independently saved, verified and logged before any overwrite."
    IDS_OVERWRITE_OFF "Keeping originals: OFF. Overwritten data and old ADS will have NO recovery copy from this run."
    IDS_OVERWRITE_PUBLISHED_ERROR "The replacement was published, but final checks failed. It remains in place. Inspect the target and any recovery copy."
    IDS_OVERWRITE_FAILED "The overwrite worker failed. Some files may have been replaced. Inspect both trees and any recovery folder before retrying."
    IDS_OVERWRITE_RECOVERY "Original copies verified and logged: %llu of %llu"
    IDS_OVERWRITE_INCOMPLETE "The run is incomplete. Completed replacements remain; inspect the result and any manifests."
    IDS_OVERWRITE_RECOVERY_ERROR "Preserving an original failed; no overwrites were started."
    IDS_SETTINGS_FAILED "The recovery setting could not be saved. It remains in effect for this session only."
    IDS_RECOVERY_DISABLED "Keeping originals is disabled. Enable Keep originals in the plugin preferences to create recovery copies."
    IDS_RECOVERY_SPACE_ON "Recovery copies use additional disk space."
    IDS_RECOVERY_SPACE_OFF "Off: no recovery copies; existing backups are kept."
    IDS_SAVE_EMPTY "No visible copy proposal has an existing, supported file on both sides. Nothing to save."
    IDS_SAVE_ROOT "Set an existing recovery folder outside both compared trees in the plugin preferences."
    IDS_SAVE_INCOMPLETE "The run is incomplete. Inspect the manifest and saved files; do not treat it as a completed recovery set."
    IDS_SAVE_FAILED "The recovery worker failed. Originals remain unchanged. Inspect the recovery folder and manifest before retrying."
    IDS_SAVE_PUBLISHED_ERROR "The recovery copy was published, but final checks failed. Inspect it before restoring."
    IDS_NAME "Directory Synchronization"
    IDS_DESCRIPTION "Directory comparison and synchronization."
    IDS_MENU "Directory synchronization..."
    IDS_INPUT_ERROR "Both panels must contain Windows folders with complete paths and decodable selected names. The current SDK cannot provide a usable input for these panels."
    IDS_STALE "This preview is unavailable or has changed. Compare again before any further action."
    IDS_CANCELLED "Cancelled. Partial results contain no actionable proposals."
    IDS_FAILED "Comparison failed. Results have been discarded."
    IDS_COPY_EMPTY "No visible eligible file or empty-directory proposal has a missing target."
    IDS_COPY_ERROR "Windows error: "
    IDS_COPY_PUBLISHED_ERROR "The new target was published, but final verification failed. It was left in place."
    IDS_COPY_REMAINDER "Staging requires manual inspection: "
    IDS_COPY_STOPPED "Stopped. Completed new items remain in place."
    IDS_COPY_FAILED "The copy worker failed. Completed files may remain. Compare again and inspect the destination before retrying."
    IDS_SELECT_ROW "Select one or more rows first. Blocked and conflicting rows cannot receive actions."
    IDS_HELP "Results are grouped by relative folder, with the root shown as \\. Headers are separators, not proposals; file rows show names and copied paths remain complete.\n\nChoose the two Windows folders and Compare. Scan checkboxes apply on the next Compare; toggling them preserves the current results and proposals. Scan panel selection uses the union of the original panel selections and locks the original roots. Subfolders adds deeper levels; selected folders include direct children.\n\nMasks are separated by spaces or semicolons; quote names containing spaces. Use | before exclusions, a leading backslash to anchor to the root, and ** for any depth. Examples: *.txt | selB\\ or selA\\**\\*.txt. Regex and saved searches are not supported.\n\nHighlight rows and use the right-click / Shift+F10 menu to change proposals, then review Visible plan > Plan summary. Ctrl+D restores the default proposal, Ctrl+M skips, Ctrl+L/R sets the copy direction, Ctrl+W reverses it. Copy paths and Ctrl+C copy displayed Unicode paths; missing sides are omitted. These commands never execute file operations. Icon filters show equal, different, single-sided and directional results; tooltips explain them. Synchronize opens separate Copy, Overwrite and Delete commands. Visible plan in the context menu also offers Plan summary and Save originals. Highlighting does not restrict these plan commands: each command uses all visible eligible proposals. Filtered out and Skip rows are excluded. Use the combined visible-plan command or run each operation separately. Only visible actions enter that summary; blocked/conflicting rows always stay visible. Copy new items executes visible file and physically empty-directory copies with missing targets after a separate confirmation. Existing targets and deletions are omitted.\n\nKeep originals is enabled by default and can be switched off. This setting and the recovery folder are remembered for this plugin. Disabling it creates no recovery copies and leaves existing backups in place. Delete items separately confirms visible Delete on right proposals from asymmetric comparison. Supported files and directories absent on the left are eligible. Directories are removed only when empty after planned child deletions. The confirmation states recovery ON/OFF; when ON all originals must first be saved and verified. When OFF deleted data and ADS have no recovery copy. The Recycle Bin is not used. Read-only files are refused.\n\nOverwrite files separately confirms replacement of visible existing-file targets. The confirmation states whether recovery is ON or OFF. When ON, all original targets must first be saved and verified outside both trees. When OFF, overwritten data and old ADS have no recovery copy from this run. Replacements keep original target permissions. Read-only targets are refused. Stop leaves completed replacements in place.\n\nSave originals separately saves original target files for visible copy proposals with an existing file on both sides. Set an existing recovery folder outside both compared trees in the plugin preferences. This creates independent verified copies and a manifest; originals remain unchanged and no proposal is executed. Permissions inherit from the recovery folder.\n\nStop beside Compare cancels scanning, comparison and read-only validation; Stop beside Synchronize cancels the chosen file operation including its validation. Only the appropriate Stop is enabled. Data and metadata are verified; Stop preserves completed files. Compare again after a run. Compare rebuilds proposals; reapply manual Skip if needed."
